{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-053.md","record_count":28,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s053-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தசேனை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா! உன் உடலைத்தான் எல்லாரால் கட்டிப் போட முடிந்தது, உயிரைக் கட்ட முடியவில்லை. அது வெகு சீக்கிரத்தில் விடுதலை பெற்று வேறு உலகத்திற்குப் போய்விடும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா! (உக்ரசேனன் அடிக்கிறான்)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"உக்ரசேனன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹூம் ஐயோ பாவம் இந்த மழலைக் குழந்தை மாதாவை அழைக்கிறது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பரிதாபத்துக்குரியவனே! வாய் வலிக்க தாயை ஏன் அழைக்கிறாய்? கொஞ்சம் காத்திரு! உன் பாட்டி இருக்கும் பரலோகத்திற்கே உன்னை அனுப்பி வைக்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம். முதலில் குழந்தை! பிறகு மனோகரன்! அவன் கண்ணுக்கு நேராகவே அவன் கண்மணியைக் கொல்லவேண்டும். ஆயா! போ! குழந்தையைக் கொண்டுவா;","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":79}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அண்ணா என்ன இது? உன்னை யார் கட்டிப் போட்டது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வா இங்கே","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முடியாது... எல்லாம் உன்னுடைய வேலைதானே! அம்மா... அண்ணனை அவிழ்த்து விடு! உம்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தா... சும்மா இரு. உனக்கொன்றும் தெரியாது","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்கெல்லாம் தெரியும். என் பிரியமுள்ள அப்பா, பெரியம்மா, அண்ணி எல்லோரையும் சிறையிலே போட்டே, அண்ணனையும் கட்டிப் போட்டு அடிக்க ஆரம்பிச்சுட்டே, என்னால் இதை அனுமதிக்க முடியாது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அண்ணா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அண்ணா!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d017","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தா வா இப்படி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d018","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அண்ணா அந்த சங்கிலியெல்லாம் அறுத்தெறி...... விடம்மா என்னை!\n\n(ஒரு அறைக்குள் இழுத்து வருகிறாள்).\n\nவிடு என்னை... விடு என்னை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d019","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சும்மாயிரு எல்லாம் உன் நன்மைக்காகத்தான் செய்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d020","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! அண்ணனைக் கட்டிப் போட்டு கொல்றது தம்பியின் நன்மைக்காகவா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d021","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்ணே நீ ராஜாவாக வேண்டாமா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d022","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜாவா? வேண்டாம்! வேண்டாம். அப்புறம் உன்கிட்டம் ஒரு ராணி வந்து சிறையிலே போடுவா! செத்தாலும் சாகிறேன். அந்த சிம்மாசனம் வேண்டாம்மா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d023","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எல்லாம் என் தலைவிதி! என் வயிற்றிலே வந்து நீ பிறந்தாயே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d024","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுக்காகத்தான் நானும் கவலைப்படுறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d025","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாயை மூடு","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":80}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d026","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முடியாது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":82,"printed_page":81}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d027","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முடியாதா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":82,"printed_page":81}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"manohara-s053-d028","scene_id":"manohara-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா! அம்மா! (கதவை சாத்திப்போகிறாள்)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":82,"printed_page":81}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"}]}